# Build output
build/

# Swift Package Manager / Xcode leftovers. The SwiftUI app was deleted in #262,
# but its build directory and generated project can still exist on disk from
# before that. These rules used to live in a large stock Xcode template; when
# that template was removed as dead, `.build/` and the .xcodeproj went with it
# and `git add -A` committed 174 MB of artifacts (#266). Kept explicitly.
.build/
.swiftpm/
*.xcodeproj/

